          "notes": "identifier/ontology_id CHEBI:142468 ('1,2-dichloropropane') -> CHEBI:82163 ('rac-1,2-dichloropropane'). The record's own cas_rn 78-87-5 is registered by ChEBI against CHEBI:82163, which is the racemate of the term the record previously carried. Curation decision on #320: where the CAS names a more specific FORM than the label, the CAS governs — the recipe is taken to mean the substance actually weighed out. These surfaced as 'unrelated' in the ancestry triage only because ChEBI does not model salt-of / hydrate-of / racemate-of as subsumption, the same gap #342 recorded for hydrates."
        }
      ]
