          "notes": "Imported from CultureBotHT. CAS-RN 16373-93-6 present, but no CHEBI entry exists (checked OAK CHEBI sqlite + PubChem CID synonyms). Curator can promote to a CHEBI primary if/when CHEBI adds the term."
        },
        {
          "evidence_type": "DATABASE_MATCH",
          "source": "anchor_cas_hydrate_records",
          "notes": "2-Deoxyadenosine monohydrate is a hydrate/salt with its own CAS and no exact ChEBI term; anchored to the parent CHEBI:17256 '2'-deoxyadenosine' by narrowMatch per MAPPING_SEMANTICS.md Section 3 step 2. monohydrate of 2'-deoxyadenosine"
        },
        {
          "evidence_type": "DATABASE_MATCH",
          "source": "MIM curation (#342)",
          "notes": "mapping_quality NARROW_MATCH -> CLOSE_MATCH, predicate skos:narrowMatch -> skos:closeMatch. narrowMatch asserts this record is *narrower in meaning* than CHEBI:17256 (\"2'-deoxyadenosine\") — a subsumption ChEBI itself denies: it files hydrates under CHEBI:35505 'hydrate', never under the anhydrous compound, which is not an ancestor even transitively. A hydrate is a distinct substance containing the anhydrous form, not a specialization of it. closeMatch claims similarity without subsumption. The ontology_id and the record's own identifier are unchanged."
        },
        {
          "evidence_type": "MANUAL_CURATION",
          "source": "MIM Step7d scientific review (#901)",
          "notes": "The historical D7400 monohydrate and fresh supplier deposit/PubChem CAS16373-93-6 agree. Keep this own CAS distinct from the separate CHEBI17256 parent owner. No form-specific CHEBI/NCIT candidate was established by the recorded bounded queries. Retain CHEBI17256 as hydrate-of parent; NARROW_MATCH exports skos:broadMatch, not identity or subclass_of. Formula C10H15N5O4 and water-containing InChI/CID9549172 agree with the monohydrate. SMILES lacks stereo annotation but does not assert the opposite stereoisomer; the InChI retains stereo. Do not replace or extend chemistry in this batch. Primary source references: https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/rest/pug/substance/sourceid/Sigma-Aldrich/D7400_SIGMA/JSON; https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/rest/pug/compound/name/16373-93-6/property/Title,MolecularFormula,MolecularWeight,InChI,InChIKey,CanonicalSMILES/JSON; https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/backend/api/public/compound/17256/. Captures, exact input hashes and scope limits: reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/evidence-manifest.json. This curation adds no scientific, mapping-release or role approval; changed owner bytes withdraw inherited support."
        }
      ]
