        {
          "evidence_type": "DATABASE_MATCH",
          "source": "microbedecoder original CSV; BacDive; ChEBI",
          "notes": "Exact original 2,5-didehydro-D-gluconate labels occur twice, both in BacDive_Metabolite_production: CSV line 2121 / BacDive 34 and line 8749 / BacDive 58. Each source cell separately contains the mono-keto label. CHEBI:11449 denotes this di-keto anion, distinct from CHEBI:58143. The archived BacDive production results for CHEBI:11449 in strains 34 and 58 are explicitly No (ph-x/text-danger icons, alt=No and title=No). Empty text extraction had omitted those result attributes. The count of two remains source-field label appearances; neither positive production nor a chemical role is inferred. Recovered legacy damaged label 5-didehydro-D-gluconate is retained as RAW_TEXT on this source-established identity under the damaged-label exception; it must not resolve to the mono-keto owner. Clarification: https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/313#issuecomment-6588401935 . No CAS, recipe occurrence or inherited mono-keto chemistry is added. Sources: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/CHEBI:11449 ; https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/CHEBI:58143 ; https://bacdive.dsmz.de/strain/34 ; https://bacdive.dsmz.de/strain/58 . https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/313#issuecomment-6588292718. Hash-bound source captures: reports/step7c_source_labels_313_235_20261102/source-evidence.json (sha256 1a7185b74de90578fe5f42d3d44cf7c798dccb5e5fd56fc3c1c01885499b85d0). Source-field counts are not recipe occurrences or positive experimental outcomes. Preserved superseded source assertions and history. No scientific/release approval is asserted. Inspected the archived Metabolite production tables at https://bacdive.dsmz.de/strain/34 and https://bacdive.dsmz.de/strain/58. Headers bind the exact CHEBI:11449/name row to the Production column; both cells explicitly encode No in icon alt/title attributes and ph-x classes. Neighboring mono-keto controls encode Yes (ph-check); their original ChEBI links are retained verbatim without assigning that source link as a new MIM identity. Exact headers, row HTML, icon attributes and immutable input hashes: reports/diketo_bacdive_evidence_1111_20261102/source-evidence.json sha256=41defe43ca5fc06502964d155ea58376d5420c0ce2cb8ffe660294c18638d892. Finding https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1111; decision https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1111#issuecomment-6588588040."
        }
      ]
    },
