      "ontology_id": "CHEBI:16388",
      "ontology_label": "4-hydroxymandelic acid",
      "ontology_source": "CHEBI",
      "mapping_quality": "NARROW_MATCH",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "evidence_type": "DATABASE_MATCH",
          "source": "CultureBotHT",
          "notes": "Imported from CultureBotHT. CAS-RN 184901-84-6 present, but no CHEBI entry exists (checked OAK CHEBI sqlite + PubChem CID synonyms). Curator can promote to a CHEBI primary if/when CHEBI adds the term."
        },
        {
          "evidence_type": "DATABASE_MATCH",
          "source": "CHEBI via OLS (stem-substring)",
          "notes": "Parent class identified via stem-substring; matched_via='4-Hydroxymandelic acid monohydrate'"
        },
        {
          "evidence_type": "DATABASE_MATCH",
          "source": "MIM curation (#342)",
          "notes": "mapping_quality NARROW_MATCH -> CLOSE_MATCH, predicate skos:narrowMatch -> skos:closeMatch. narrowMatch asserts this record is *narrower in meaning* than CHEBI:16388 ('4-hydroxymandelic acid') — a subsumption ChEBI itself denies: it files hydrates under CHEBI:35505 'hydrate', never under the anhydrous compound, which is not an ancestor even transitively. A hydrate is a distinct substance containing the anhydrous form, not a specialization of it. closeMatch claims similarity without subsumption. The ontology_id and the record's own identifier are unchanged."
        },
        {
          "evidence_type": "MANUAL_CURATION",
          "source": "MIM Step7d scientific review (#901)",
          "notes": "Historical168327 and current supplier/PubChem agree on CAS184901-84-6 monohydrate, not the water-free parent. Keep CHEBI16388 as closest verified parent, change quality to NARROW_MATCH and export broadMatch with separate identities. Current formula C8H10O5, water-containing SMILES/InChI and CID12677290 match monohydrate. No replacement proposed. Primary source references: https://www.sigmaaldrich.com/US/en/product/aldrich/168327; https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/rest/pug/substance/sid/24850239/JSON; https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/rest/pug/compound/name/184901-84-6/property/Title,MolecularFormula,MolecularWeight,InChI,InChIKey,CanonicalSMILES/JSON; https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/backend/api/public/compound/16388/. Captures, exact input hashes and scope limits: reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/evidence-manifest.json. Independent review identifies the existing exact synonym 'hydroxy(4-hydroxyphenyl)acetic acid' as the water-free parent, not this hydrate; preserve it as REJECTED_LABEL. This curation adds no scientific, mapping-release or role approval; changed owner bytes withdraw inherited support."
        }
      ]
    },
