          "notes": "Historical/current F5013 support a distinct hydrate CAS207291-81-4; water count is unspecified. Preserve own CAS, do not rename it monohydrate. Keep CHEBI74498 free acid as parent and NARROW_MATCH/broadMatch; no exact monohydrate promotion. Current formula/SMILES/InChI/CID16212749 encode exactly one water, while source F5013 explicitly gives xH2O. Withdraw these four unqualified fields; do not replace them with zero-water or guessed hydrate values. Primary source references: https://www.sigmaaldrich.com/US/en/product/sigma/f5013; https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/rest/pug/substance/sourceid/Sigma-Aldrich/F5013_SIGMA/JSON; https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/rest/pug/compound/name/207291-81-4/property/Title,MolecularFormula,MolecularWeight,InChI,InChIKey,CanonicalSMILES/JSON; https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/backend/api/public/compound/74498/. Captures, exact input hashes and scope limits: reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/evidence-manifest.json. Independent review identifies the existing exact synonym '5-fluoro-2,6-dioxo-1,2,3,6-tetrahydropyrimidine-4-carboxylic acid' as the water-free parent, not this hydrate; preserve it as REJECTED_LABEL. This curation adds no scientific, mapping-release or role approval; changed owner bytes withdraw inherited support."
        }
      ]
    },
