          "notes": "MediaDive578 and five current source recipes name CoCl2·2H2O; publisher-deposited primary abstract reports single-crystal CoCl2·2H2O. Retain the local two-water identity, without selecting an unverified CAS lead. No exact eligible term was established by bounded queries. CHEBI35696 is the closest verified water-free parent; use NARROW_MATCH/broadMatch and retain exact local identity. Current2Cl.Co.2H2O matches the source-defined stoichiometry. Dry structure fields were removed in7b and remain absent. Computed PubChem is corroboration, not the sole experimental proof. Primary source references: https://api.crossref.org/works/10.1063/1.1726454; https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/rest/pug/compound/cid/129656378/property/Title,MolecularFormula,MolecularWeight,InChI,InChIKey,CanonicalSMILES/JSON; https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/backend/api/public/compound/35696/. Captures, exact input hashes and scope limits: reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/evidence-manifest.json. This curation adds no scientific, mapping-release or role approval; changed owner bytes withdraw inherited support."
        }
      ]
    },
