          "notes": "Catalogue line142 identifies Sigma48280 D-galacturonic acid monohydrate, CAS91510-62-2,212.15. The inspected Wako primary product independently gives that CAS and one-water formula. ParentCHEBI18024 explicitly denotes D-galacturonic acid. Bounded ontology discovery found no exact eligible hydrate term; retain own CAS and make the parent relation broadMatch. See the complete identity, mapping, chemistry and synonym assessment in reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/authors/science-b/full-assessments.json; owner selector data/ingredients/mapped/D-Galacturonic_Acid_Monohydrate.yaml. Primary source references: https://github.com/CultureBotAI/CultureBotHT; https://labchem-wako.fujifilm.com/us/product/detail/W01W0232-5034.html; https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/backend/api/public/compound/18024/; https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/rest/pug/compound/name/91510-62-2/property/MolecularFormula,MolecularWeight,InChI,InChIKey,IUPACName/JSON. Captures, exact input hashes and scope limits: reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/evidence-manifest.json. This curation adds no scientific, mapping-release or role approval; changed owner bytes withdraw inherited support."
        }
