          "source": "MIM Step7d scientific review (#901)",
          "notes": "Catalogueline1336/CAS172669-64-6/FW221.21 identifies Gly-Gln monohydrate. PubChemCAS gives the L-glutamine dipeptide with one water and CHEBI73898 is the corresponding water-free glycyl-L-glutamine parent. Retain hydrate CAS and broadMatch; do not collapse into the parent. See the complete identity, mapping, chemistry and synonym assessment in reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/authors/science-b/full-assessments.json; owner selector data/ingredients/mapped/Gly-Gln_Monohydrate.yaml. Primary source references: https://github.com/CultureBotAI/CultureBotHT; https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/backend/api/public/compound/73898/; https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/rest/pug/compound/name/172669-64-6/property/MolecularFormula,MolecularWeight,InChI,InChIKey,IUPACName/JSON; https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/326. Captures, exact input hashes and scope limits: reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/evidence-manifest.json. This curation adds no scientific, mapping-release or role approval; changed owner bytes withdraw inherited support."
