          "notes": "Catalogueline1338 CAS23537-25-9/FW187.17 and PubChemCID12308854 establish L-cysteic acid monohydrate, including the L-specific stereochemical InChI. CHEBI17285 is L-cysteicacid without water. No exacthydrate candidate found; retainCAS and broadMatch plus separate B1registry. See the complete identity, mapping, chemistry and synonym assessment in reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/authors/science-b/full-assessments.json; owner selector data/ingredients/mapped/L-Cysteic_Acid_Monohydrate.yaml. Primary source references: https://github.com/CultureBotAI/CultureBotHT; https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/rest/pug/compound/name/23537-25-9/property/MolecularFormula,MolecularWeight,InChI,InChIKey,IUPACName/JSON; https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/backend/api/public/compound/17285/. Captures, exact input hashes and scope limits: reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/evidence-manifest.json. This curation adds no scientific, mapping-release or role approval; changed owner bytes withdraw inherited support."
        }
