          "notes": "MediaDive REST gives CAS 13446-18-9 = magnesium nitrate hexahydrate for source name 'Mg(NO3)2 x 6 H2O'. CHEBI has only the anhydrous parent (CHEBI:64736 'magnesium nitrate'), so the hexahydrate is a narrowMatch to it, with cas:13446-18-9 preserved as the exact-identity primary (cf. ammonium molybdate tetrahydrate)."
