          "source": "MIM curation (#213/#308)",
          "notes": "The label enumerates its own constituents, so this is a decomposition rather than a mapping: no ontology has a term for 'Peptone + Yeast Extract', and none could — a combination is not a substance. Minted under the #288 STOCK_SOLUTION convention and split on '+', which transcribes the label rather than inferring anything. 2 of 2 constituents resolve to existing MIM records via docs/data/label_index.csv. ingredient_type=UNDEFINED_MIXTURE because at least one constituent is itself an undefined preparation. No concentrations are recorded: the label states none."
        }
      ]
    },
