          "evidence_type": "DATABASE_MATCH",
          "source": "CultureBotHT",
          "notes": "Imported from CultureBotHT. CAS-RN 1030365-02-6 present, but no CHEBI entry exists (checked OAK CHEBI sqlite + PubChem CID synonyms). Curator can promote to a CHEBI primary if/when CHEBI adds the term."
        },
        {
          "evidence_type": "DATABASE_MATCH",
          "source": "anchor_cas_hydrate_records",
          "notes": "potassium citramalate monohydrate is a hydrate/salt with its own CAS and no exact ChEBI term; anchored to the parent CHEBI:15584 'citramalic acid' by narrowMatch per MAPPING_SEMANTICS.md Section 3 step 2. potassium salt monohydrate of citramalic acid"
        },
        {
          "evidence_type": "DATABASE_MATCH",
          "source": "MIM curation (#342)",
          "notes": "mapping_quality NARROW_MATCH -> CLOSE_MATCH, predicate skos:narrowMatch -> skos:closeMatch. narrowMatch asserts this record is *narrower in meaning* than CHEBI:15584 ('citramalic acid') — a subsumption ChEBI itself denies: it files hydrates under CHEBI:35505 'hydrate', never under the anhydrous compound, which is not an ancestor even transitively. A hydrate is a distinct substance containing the anhydrous form, not a specialization of it. closeMatch claims similarity without subsumption. The ontology_id and the record's own identifier are unchanged."
        },
        {
          "evidence_type": "MANUAL_CURATION",
          "source": "MIM Step7d scientific review (#901)",
          "notes": "SourceCAS1030365-02-6/name/mass242.31 are independently corroborated by primarySigma27455monohydrate. PreserveCAS and unspecific preferred label; do not assert a single enantiomer. See the complete identity, mapping, chemistry and synonym assessment in reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/authors/science-c/assessments-v2.json; owner selector data/ingredients/mapped/Potassium_Citramalate_Monohydrate.yaml. Primary source references: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/backend/api/public/compound/15584/; https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/api/search?q=potassium%20citramalate%20monohydrate&ontology=chebi,ncit&rows=100; https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/rest/pug/compound/name/1030365-02-6/JSON; https://www.sigmaaldrich.com/US/en/product/aldrich/27455; https://github.com/CultureBotAI/CultureBotHT. Captures, exact input hashes and scope limits: reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/evidence-manifest.json. This curation adds no scientific, mapping-release or role approval; changed owner bytes withdraw inherited support."
        }
      ]
    },
