        {
          "evidence_type": "DATABASE_MATCH",
          "source": "anchor_cas_hydrate_records",
          "notes": "potassium tellurate hydrate is a hydrate/salt with its own CAS and no exact ChEBI term; anchored to the parent CHEBI:30463 'telluric acid' by narrowMatch per MAPPING_SEMANTICS.md Section 3 step 2. potassium salt hydrate of telluric acid (H2O4Te, neutral, 3-STAR). NOT CHEBI:30464 tellurate, which is the (2-) anion: a neutral salt is not a kind of a dianion"
        },
        {
          "evidence_type": "DATABASE_MATCH",
          "source": "MIM curation (#342)",
          "notes": "mapping_quality NARROW_MATCH -> CLOSE_MATCH, predicate skos:narrowMatch -> skos:closeMatch. narrowMatch asserts this record is *narrower in meaning* than CHEBI:30463 ('telluric acid') — a subsumption ChEBI itself denies: it files hydrates under CHEBI:35505 'hydrate', never under the anhydrous compound, which is not an ancestor even transitively. A hydrate is a distinct substance containing the anhydrous form, not a specialization of it. closeMatch claims similarity without subsumption. The ontology_id and the record's own identifier are unchanged."
        },
        {
          "evidence_type": "MANUAL_CURATION",
          "source": "MIM Step7d scientific review (#901)",
          "notes": "SourceCAS314041-10-6 names potassiumtelluratehydrate. Primarysupplier confirmsK2TeO4·xH2O; distinctCAS preserves this nominalvariablehydrate. See the complete identity, mapping, chemistry and synonym assessment in reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/authors/science-c/assessments-v2.json; owner selector data/ingredients/mapped/Potassium_Tellurate_Hydrate.yaml. Primary source references: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/backend/api/public/compound/30463/; https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/api/search?q=potassium%20tellurate%20hydrate&ontology=chebi,ncit&rows=100; https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/rest/pug/compound/name/314041-10-6/JSON; https://www.sigmaaldrich.com/US/en/product/aldrich/400580; https://github.com/CultureBotAI/CultureBotHT. Captures, exact input hashes and scope limits: reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/evidence-manifest.json. This curation adds no scientific, mapping-release or role approval; changed owner bytes withdraw inherited support."
        }
      ]
    },
